//// set: ir-i2 — 隐式迭代范围（模型）：if / when / while 里、参数维、`:` 维、各实例各推各的、记录数组、遮蔽、枚举 / Boolean 维
//// model: I20
model I20
  Real a = time;
  Real x[3] = {a, 2 * a, 3 * a};
  Real m[2, 3] = {{a, a, a}, {a, a, a}};
  Real y[3]; Boolean b = a > 1;
equation
  if b then for i loop y[i] = x[i]; end for; else for i loop y[i] = 0; end for; end if;
end I20;
//// model: I21
model I21
  Real a = time;
  Real x[3] = {a, 2 * a, 3 * a};
  Real m[2, 3] = {{a, a, a}, {a, a, a}};
  Real y[3](each start = 0);
equation
  when a > 1 then for i loop y[i] = pre(y[i]) + 1; end for; end when;
end I21;
//// model: I22
model I22
  Real a = time;
  Real x[3] = {a, 2 * a, 3 * a};
  Real m[2, 3] = {{a, a, a}, {a, a, a}};
  Real y[3]; initial equation for i loop y[i] = i; end for; equation for i loop der(y[i]) = x[i]; end for;
end I22;
//// model: I23
model I23
  Real a = time;
  Real x[3] = {a, 2 * a, 3 * a};
  Real m[2, 3] = {{a, a, a}, {a, a, a}};
  Real y[3]; algorithm if a > 1 then for i loop y[i] := x[i]; end for; else for i loop y[i] := 0; end for; end if;
end I23;
//// model: I24
model I24
